{"summary": "自我優化工具：在訓練場對改過的自己跑整棵樹 1 題（假腦或真腦），回凍結量尺（check／judge）打的分、token、叫工具順序；真腦用量記進 session 預算",
 "time_ms": {"val": 20000, "max": 1200000},
 "resource": ["cpu", "disk"],
 "side_effect": true,
 "idempotent": false,
 "deterministic": false,
 "interrupt": "safe",
 "parallel": false,
 "reads": ["$SELFOPT_SESSION", "$AOS_WS/set/<題>.json", "$AOS_WS/tree/"],
 "writes": ["$AOS_WS/selfopt/<session>/tests/<k>/（一次跑的工作區）", "$SELFOPT_SESSION（counter_tokens_tests、self_tests）"],
 "calls": ["aos-exec --ws <k> $AOS_WS/tree（真腦時 tree 裡的 agent 會問腦，用量算在 tree 各自的 llm.jsonl）"],
 "grow_level": 3,
 "uses_llm": false}
